# LeakSanitizer suppressions for `make fuzz`. Only libFuzzer's own allocations
# belong here, matched by frames that never appear above FeTerm code: a rule
# such as "leak:fuzzer::" would also hide real leaks, because every input runs
# under libFuzzer's driver frames.

# libFuzzer's RSS-monitor std::thread is never joined (seen on macOS arm64).
leak:fuzzer::StartRssThread
leak:std::__1::__thread_struct::__thread_struct
